{
  "name": "@zws/dsh-dispatch-agent-team",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "调度模式智能体团队：基于官方 Agent Teams 改良的团队插件——12 个角色编制、队员共用同一份系统提示词（只靠 Lead 的派活提示词区分角色，缓存命中率高）、队员自动摘掉 goal/子代理工具、每个队员可配模型与思考强度、还可各自选 agent 预设（PTC / 标准 / 极简灰度，可一键统一也可逐个指定；默认跟随 Lead）与「批量调用」档（默认开：原生工具照常直调，另加 run_code 在程序里批量调用），插件页支持一键统一全部角色、/team 开启、成员面板可进入工作区看团队拓扑画布（真实承接关系与运行数据）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./preset": "./lib/preset.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./roster": "./lib/roster.js",
    "./playbook": "./lib/playbook.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./ops-file": "./vendor/ops/lib/components/file/index.js",
    "./ops-file/package.json": "./vendor/ops/lib/components/file/package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "tools",
    "presets",
    "locale",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "INTERFACES.md",
    "INCIDENT-2026-10-09-managed-block.md",
    "vendor"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.3.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale": ">=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.3.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-plugin-manager": ">=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.3.0"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": [
        "./cordis.patch.yml",
        "./presets/dispatch-mode.patch.yml"
      ]
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-plugin-manager"
      ]
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "agent-teams",
    "plugin",
    "preset",
    "调度模式"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
